window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1235\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδήλητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Ileso, não ferido, invulnerável; Apolônio de Rodes, Nono. II. Ativo: que não fere nem causa dano, de vínculo; Nono.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1236\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηλία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: obscuridade, falta de clareza, incerteza, particularmente do futuro; Apolônio Díscolo, Jâmblico.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1237\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηλοποιέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: tornar invisível, ocultar de vista; Símaco, Jó 9.5; comentário ao Organon.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1238\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηλοποιός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -όν: que torna invisível, ocultador; de remédio mágico ou artifício; escólios à Ilíada e a Eurípides.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1239\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδηλος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Invisível, não visto, oculto, desconhecido, de pessoa, tropa, fato e ação; Homero e prosa clássica. II. Incerto, imprevisível, de futuro ou resultado de decis</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1240\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηλότης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ητος: incerteza, ausência de evidência, obscuridade; Protágoras, Políbio, Fílon.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1241\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηλόφλεβος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: com veias pouco visíveis ou imperceptíveis, de anatomia animal; Aristóteles.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1242\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηλόω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: tornar invisível; voz passiva, apagar-se, desaparecer de inscrição ou registro; Tábuas de Heracleia.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1243\"><td class=\"greek\">ἅδημα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ψήφισμα, «decreto, resolução votada»; Hesíquio, com variante manuscrita ἀδήμας.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1244\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδημιούργητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: não fabricado, não produzido ou moldado para certo fim; de elefante caído que não foi feito para levantar-se, Diodoro.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1245\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδημοκράτητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: não democrático, contrário à forma democrática de governo; Díon Cássio 43.45.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1246\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδημονέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: estar muito aflito, atormentado, angustiado, desorientado, perplexo, com dativo, ὑπό, ἐπί ou χάριν; Hipócrates, Platão, Demóstenes, Xenofonte. A derivação etimológica d</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1247\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδημονία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: aflição, angústia, afobação, perturbação emocional; Epicuro, Plutarco, Fílon.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1248\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδημος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: ausente do próprio povo ou país, em viagem, equivalente a ἀπόδημος; Sófocles.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1249\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδημοσύνη</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: perturbação, aflição, angústia, forma rara de ἀδημονία; Demócrito.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1250\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδήμων</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον, genitivo -ονος: profundamente aflito, angustiado; remissão a ἀδημονέω, com leitura duvidosa em Hipócrates.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1251\"><td class=\"greek\">ἅδην</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio, épico e jônico ἄδην. I. À saciedade, fartamente, até ficar satisfeito, com genitivo do que sacia; Homero, Platão. II. Até o fastio, estar farto de algo. III. Incessa</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1252\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδήν</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino ou masculino: glândula, órgão glandular; Hipócrates, Galeno; comparação etimológica com latim inguen.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1253\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηνής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ές: ignorante, inexperiente, possível conjectura textual em Semônides; os gramáticos antigos também entendem «sem intenção maliciosa». Advérbio ἀδηνέως, sem malícia;</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1254\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδηρις</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo de dois gêneros, genitivo -ιος: sem briga, pacífico, sem conflito; epigramas gregos.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1255\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδήριτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem combate, sem contenda, incontestado, indiscutível, inclusive de conquista; Ilíada, Políbio. II. A que não se pode resistir, invencível, de necessidade; És</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n2244\"><td class=\"greek\">ᾍδης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Nome próprio masculino ᾍδης, variantes épicas Ἀΐδης e dóricas Ἀΐδας. I. Hades, deus do mundo subterrâneo, irmão de Zeus e Posêidon; Ilíada, Hesíodo. II. O mundo dos mortos, mo</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1256\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁδήσω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma verbal ἁδήσω: remissão à conjugação de ἁνδάνω, «agradar, satisfazer», sem novo significado próprio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1257\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηφαγέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: ser voraz, glutão, consumir avidamente; também de cavalos vorazes ou indisciplinados; Hermipo, Sófocles, Isócrates.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1258\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδηφαγία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: voracidade, gula, glutonaria, até personificada em culto da Ἀδηφαγία; Calímaco, Aristóteles, Opiano.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n1235\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1235\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1251\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδήλητος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Ileso, não ferido, invulnerável; Apolônio de Rodes, Nono. II. Ativo: que não fere nem causa dano, de vínculo; Nono.\">ἀδήλητος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Ileso, não ferido, invulnerável; Apolônio de Rodes, Nono. II. Ativo: que não fere nem causa dano, de vínculo; Nono.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dh/lhtos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1235&quot; key=&quot;a)dh/lhtos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδήλ-ητος&quot;&gt;ἀδήλητος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;δηλέομαι&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1235.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unhurt,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0001,001:2:709&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.R.&lt;/author&gt; 2.709&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;invulnerable,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2045,001:47:617&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nonn.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;D.&lt;/title&gt; 47.617&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1235.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Act.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;not hurting,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δεσμός&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2045,001:41:199&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;41.199&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1236\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1236\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1252\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηλία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: obscuridade, falta de clareza, incerteza, particularmente do futuro; Apolônio Díscolo, Jâmblico.\">ἀδηλία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: obscuridade, falta de clareza, incerteza, particularmente do futuro; Apolônio Díscolo, Jâmblico.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhli/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1236&quot; key=&quot;a)dhli/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδηλ-ία&quot;&gt;ἀδηλία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1236.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀδηλότης, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0082,001:25:18&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.D.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pron.&lt;/title&gt; 25.18&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;abbr&gt;v.l.&lt;/abbr&gt; in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0654,002:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Corn.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;ND&lt;/title&gt; 13&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τοῦ μέλλοντος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2023,006:10:4&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Iamb.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Myst.&lt;/title&gt; 10.4&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:10:96&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 10.96&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Pall.&lt;/author&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1237\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1237\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1253\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηλοποιέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: tornar invisível, ocultar de vista; Símaco, Jó 9.5; comentário ao Organon.\">ἀδηλοποιέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: tornar invisível, ocultar de vista; Símaco, Jó 9.5; comentário ao Organon.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhlopoie/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1237&quot; key=&quot;a)dhlopoie/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδηλ-οποιέω&quot;&gt;ἀδηλοποιέω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1237.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;make unseen,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Sm.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Jb.&lt;/title&gt; 9.5, Ps.-&lt;author&gt;Alex.Aphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;in SE&lt;/title&gt; 124.3.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1238\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1238\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1254\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηλοποιός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -όν: que torna invisível, ocultador; de remédio mágico ou artifício; escólios à Ilíada e a Eurípides.\">ἀδηλοποιός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -όν: que torna invisível, ocultador; de remédio mágico ou artifício; escólios à Ilíada e a Eurípides.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhlopoio/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1238&quot; key=&quot;a)dhlopoio/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδηλ-οποιός&quot;&gt;ἀδηλοποιός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1238.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;making unseen,&lt;/i&gt; Sch. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:2:455&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 2.455&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φάρμακα&lt;/foreign&gt; Sch. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,003:1201&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Med.&lt;/title&gt; 1201&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1239\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1239\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1255\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδηλος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Invisível, não visto, oculto, desconhecido, de pessoa, tropa, fato e ação; Homero e prosa clássica. II. Incerto, imprevisív\">ἄδηλος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Invisível, não visto, oculto, desconhecido, de pessoa, tropa, fato e ação; Homero e prosa clássica. II. Incerto, imprevisível, de futuro ou resultado de decisão; construção impessoal ἄδηλόν ἐστι, «não está claro». III. Não evidente aos sentidos, em filosofia epistemológica, oposto a φανερόν e ἐναργές. IV. Ininteligível, de voz, 1 Coríntios 14.8. V. Não demonstrado. Advérbio ἀδήλως, secretamente; Hesíodo, Platão, Aristóteles.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/dhlos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1239&quot; key=&quot;a)/dhlos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδηλ-ος&quot;&gt;ἄδηλος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1239.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unseen, invisible,&lt;/i&gt; of a fish, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ποιεῖν ἑαυτὸν ἄ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,014:620b:31&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HA&lt;/title&gt; 620b31&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. χιτών,&lt;/foreign&gt; of the hyaloid membrane of the eye, [&lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt;]14.712; &lt;i&gt;unknown, obscure,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,002:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Op.&lt;/title&gt; 6&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸν ἄ. ἄνδρα . . ἰχνεύειν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:475&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 475&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐὰν δὲ . . ἄ. ὁ κτείνας ᾖ&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:874a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 874a&lt;/bibl&gt;; of troops, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. τοῖς πολεμίοις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:6:3:13&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 6.3.13&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰς τὸ ἄ. ἀποκρύπτειν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,012:5:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.Mag.&lt;/title&gt; 5.7&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1239.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; mostly of things, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. θάνατοι&lt;/foreign&gt; death &lt;i&gt;by an unknown hand,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:496&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 496&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. ἔχθρα&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;secret&lt;/i&gt; enmity, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:8:108&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 8.108&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ῥεῖ πᾶν ἄδηλον&lt;/foreign&gt; melts all &lt;i&gt;to nothing,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:698&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 698&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;inscrutable,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,016:1318&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 1318&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;b&quot; id=&quot;n1239.2&quot; level=&quot;4&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; neut., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄδηλόν [ἐστι] εἰ&lt;/foreign&gt; . . &lt;i&gt;it is uncertain&lt;/i&gt; whether . ., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,012:232e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Phdr.&lt;/title&gt; 232e&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. μή&lt;/foreign&gt; . . &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,004:91d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Phd.&lt;/title&gt; 91d&lt;/bibl&gt;: abs., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. ὄν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:1:2&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 1.2&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν ἀδήλῳ εἶναι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0028,005:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Antipho&lt;/author&gt; 5.6&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν ἀδηλοτέρῳ εἶναι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,001:7:5:8&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HG&lt;/title&gt; 7.5.8&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐξ ἀδήλου ἔρχεται [σελήνη]&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:871:5&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 871.5&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; also &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ.&lt;/foreign&gt; agreeing with the subject (like &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δίκαιός εἰμι&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;, παῖδες ἄ. ὁποτέρων,&lt;/foreign&gt; = ἄδηλον ὁποτέρων παῖδές εἰσιν, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,001:33&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 1.33&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδήλοις . . πῶς ἀποβήσεται,&lt;/foreign&gt; = ἃ ἄ. ἐστι πῶς ἀ., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,010:1112b:9&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;EN&lt;/title&gt; 1112b9&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:1:1:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mem.&lt;/title&gt; 1.1.6&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1239.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;not evident to sense,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὄψις τῶν ἀ. τὰ φαινόμενα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Anaxag.&lt;/author&gt; 21a&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0537,006:1p.6U&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Epicur.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ep.&lt;/title&gt; 1 p.6 U.&lt;/bibl&gt;; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φανερόν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1595,472:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sign.&lt;/title&gt; 6&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐναργές,&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1595,472:14&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;14&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1321,001:8&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Diog.Oen.&lt;/author&gt; 8&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1239.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;unintelligible,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φωνή&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,007:14:8&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;1 Ep.Cor.&lt;/title&gt; 14.8&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;4&quot; id=&quot;n1239.5&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;unproved,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Stoic.&lt;/author&gt; 2.89. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1239.6&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-λως&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;secretly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:1:92&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 1.92&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.: &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;comp&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Sup.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ότατα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:7:50&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 7.50&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1240\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1240\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1256\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηλότης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ητος: incerteza, ausência de evidência, obscuridade; Protágoras, Políbio, Fílon.\">ἀδηλότης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ητος: incerteza, ausência de evidência, obscuridade; Protágoras, Políbio, Fílon.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhlo/ths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1240&quot; key=&quot;a)dhlo/ths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδηλ-ότης&quot;&gt;ἀδηλότης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ητος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1240.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;uncertainty,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1635,001:4&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Protag.&lt;/author&gt; 4&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:5:2:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 5.2.3&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0018,001:1:277&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ph.&lt;/author&gt; 1.277&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0654,002:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Corn.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;ND&lt;/title&gt; 13&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1241\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1241\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1257\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηλόφλεβος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: com veias pouco visíveis ou imperceptíveis, de anatomia animal; Aristóteles.\">ἀδηλόφλεβος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: com veias pouco visíveis ou imperceptíveis, de anatomia animal; Aristóteles.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhlo/flebos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1241&quot; key=&quot;a)dhlo/flebos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδηλ-όφλεβος&quot;&gt;ἀδηλόφλεβος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1241.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;with inconspicuous veins,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,012:727a:24&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;GA&lt;/title&gt; 727a24&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,030:667a:31&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PA&lt;/title&gt; 667a31&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1242\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1242\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1258\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηλόω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: tornar invisível; voz passiva, apagar-se, desaparecer de inscrição ou registro; Tábuas de Heracleia.\">ἀδηλόω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: tornar invisível; voz passiva, apagar-se, desaparecer de inscrição ou registro; Tábuas de Heracleia.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhlo/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1242&quot; key=&quot;a)dhlo/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδηλ-όω&quot;&gt;ἀδηλόω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1242.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;render invisible&lt;/i&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;to be obliterated,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Tab.Heracl.&lt;/author&gt; 1.57.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1243\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1243\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1259\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἅδημα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ψήφισμα, «decreto, resolução votada»; Hesíquio, com variante manuscrita ἀδήμας.\">ἅδημα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ψήφισμα, «decreto, resolução votada»; Hesíquio, com variante manuscrita ἀδήμας.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(/dhma&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1243&quot; key=&quot;a(/dhma&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἅδημα&quot;&gt;ἅδημα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1243.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ψήφισμα, &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt; (cod. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδήμας&lt;/foreign&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1244\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1244\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1260\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδημιούργητος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: não fabricado, não produzido ou moldado para certo fim; de elefante caído que não foi feito para levantar-se, Diodoro.\">ἀδημιούργητος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: não fabricado, não produzido ou moldado para certo fim; de elefante caído que não foi feito para levantar-se, Diodoro.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhmiou/rghtos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1244&quot; key=&quot;a)dhmiou/rghtos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδημιούργητος&quot;&gt;ἀδημιούργητος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1244.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;not fashioned,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. πρὸς ἀνάστασιν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;not made for&lt;/i&gt; getting up again, of a fallen elephant, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0060,001:3:27&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.S.&lt;/author&gt; 3.27&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1245\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1245\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1261\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδημοκράτητος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: não democrático, contrário à forma democrática de governo; Díon Cássio 43.45.\">ἀδημοκράτητος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: não democrático, contrário à forma democrática de governo; Díon Cássio 43.45.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhmokra/thtos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1245&quot; key=&quot;a)dhmokra/thtos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδημοκράτητος&quot;&gt;ἀδημοκράτητος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1245.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;not democratic,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0385,001:43:45&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.C.&lt;/author&gt; 43.45&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1246\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1246\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1262\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδημονέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: estar muito aflito, atormentado, angustiado, desorientado, perplexo, com dativo, ὑπό, ἐπί ou χάριν; Hipócrates, Platão, Demóstenes, X\">ἀδημονέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: estar muito aflito, atormentado, angustiado, desorientado, perplexo, com dativo, ὑπό, ἐπί ou χάριν; Hipócrates, Platão, Demóstenes, Xenofonte. A derivação etimológica do substantivo hipotético ἀδήμων é incerta.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhmone/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1246&quot; key=&quot;a)dhmone/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδημονέω&quot;&gt;ἀδημονέω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1246.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;to be sorely troubled&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;dismayed, be in anguish,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,037:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Virg.&lt;/title&gt; 1&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδημονῶν τε καὶ ἀπορῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,006:175d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tht.&lt;/title&gt; 175d&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,019:197&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 19.197&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδημονῆσαι τὰς ψυχάς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,001:4:4:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HG&lt;/title&gt; 4.4.3&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: c. dat. rei, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδημονεῖ τᾗ ἀτοπίᾳ τοῦ πάθους&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,012:251d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Phdr.&lt;/title&gt; 251d&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὑπό τινος&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;to be puzzled&lt;/i&gt; by . ., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0537,003:11:8&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Epicur.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Nat.&lt;/title&gt; 11.8&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπί τινι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,001:3:70&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; 3.70&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;χάριν τινός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Oxy.:298:45&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;POxy.&lt;/title&gt; 298.45&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;date&gt;(i A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;. (&lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4083,001:833:15&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Eust.&lt;/author&gt;, 833.15&lt;/bibl&gt;, derives it from &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδήμων,&lt;/foreign&gt; which is found only as &lt;abbr&gt;v.l.&lt;/abbr&gt; in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,006:1:3:18&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epid.&lt;/title&gt; 1.18&lt;/bibl&gt; (cf. &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 17 (1).177), and is itself of doubtful derivation.) [&lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾰδ-&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Nic.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 16&lt;/cit&gt;.]&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1247\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1247\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1263\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδημονία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: aflição, angústia, afobação, perturbação emocional; Epicuro, Plutarco, Fílon.\">ἀδημονία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: aflição, angústia, afobação, perturbação emocional; Epicuro, Plutarco, Fílon.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhmoni/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1247&quot; key=&quot;a)dhmoni/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδημονία&quot;&gt;ἀδημονία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1247.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;trouble, distress,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0537,003:483&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Epicur.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 483&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:12:226&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 12.226&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Strat.&lt;/author&gt;), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,005:4&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Num.&lt;/title&gt; 4&lt;/bibl&gt;: pl., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0018,001:2:541&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ph.&lt;/author&gt; 2.541&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1248\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1248\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1264\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδημος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: ausente do próprio povo ou país, em viagem, equivalente a ἀπόδημος; Sófocles.\">ἄδημος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: ausente do próprio povo ou país, em viagem, equivalente a ἀπόδημος; Sófocles.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/dhmos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1248&quot; key=&quot;a)/dhmos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδημος&quot;&gt;ἄδημος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1248.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀπόδημος, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:639&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 639&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1249\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1249\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1265\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδημοσύνη\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: perturbação, aflição, angústia, forma rara de ἀδημονία; Demócrito.\">ἀδημοσύνη</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: perturbação, aflição, angústia, forma rara de ἀδημονία; Demócrito.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhmosu/nh&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1249&quot; key=&quot;a)dhmosu/nh&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδημοσύνη&quot;&gt;ἀδημοσύνη&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, rarer form for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδημονία,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0161,001:212&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Democr.&lt;/author&gt; 212&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; ap.&lt;title&gt;AB&lt;/title&gt; 80.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1250\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1250\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1266\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδήμων\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον, genitivo -ονος: profundamente aflito, angustiado; remissão a ἀδημονέω, com leitura duvidosa em Hipócrates.\">ἀδήμων</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον, genitivo -ονος: profundamente aflito, angustiado; remissão a ἀδημονέω, com leitura duvidosa em Hipócrates.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dh/mwn&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1250&quot; key=&quot;a)dh/mwn&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδήμων&quot;&gt;ἀδήμων&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, gen. &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ονος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1250.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;sore-troubled,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; sub &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδημονέω&lt;/foreign&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1251\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1251\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1267\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἅδην\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio, épico e jônico ἄδην. I. À saciedade, fartamente, até ficar satisfeito, com genitivo do que sacia; Homero, Platão. II. Até o fastio\">ἅδην</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio, épico e jônico ἄδην. I. À saciedade, fartamente, até ficar satisfeito, com genitivo do que sacia; Homero, Platão. II. Até o fastio, estar farto de algo. III. Incessantemente, Apolônio de Rodes. IV. Suficientemente, bastante; Calímaco.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(/dhn&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1251&quot; key=&quot;a(/dhn&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἅδην&quot;&gt;ἅδην&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ep.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; and &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ion.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄδην&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;sense id=&quot;n1251.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;to oneʼs fill,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔδμεναι ἄ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:5:203&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 5.203&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, al.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐμπιμπλάμενοι σίτων ἅ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,008:272c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Plt.&lt;/title&gt; 272c&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πιοῦσʼ ἄ. χορεύω&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Anacreont.&lt;/title&gt; 14.30&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1251.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; c. gen., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἵ μιν ἄ. ἐλόωσι . . πολέμοιο&lt;/foreign&gt; will drive him &lt;i&gt;to satiety&lt;/i&gt; of war, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:13:315&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 13.315&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Τρῶας ἄ. ἐλάσαι πολέμοιο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:19:423&quot;&gt;19.423&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔτι μίν φημι ἄ. ἐλάαν κακότητος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:5:290&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 5.290&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἅ. ἔλειξεν αἵματος&lt;/foreign&gt; licked &lt;i&gt;his fill&lt;/i&gt; of blood, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:828&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 828&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;καὶ τούτων μὲν ἅ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,001:11e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Euthphr.&lt;/title&gt; 11e&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:341c&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 341c&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἅ. ἔχειν τινός&lt;/foreign&gt; to have &lt;i&gt;enough of&lt;/i&gt; a thing, be &lt;i&gt;weary of&lt;/i&gt; it, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,018:153d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Chrm.&lt;/title&gt; 153d&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,010:975&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 975&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τοῦ φαγεῖν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:950a:15&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 950a15&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἅ. ἔχουσιν οἱ λόγοι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:541b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 541b&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: c. &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;part.&lt;/mood&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. εἶχον κτείνοντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:9:39&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 9.39&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1251.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;unceasingly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0001,001:2:82&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.R.&lt;/author&gt; 2.82&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0001,001:4:1216&quot;&gt;4.1216&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;4&quot; id=&quot;n1251.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; = ἅλις, ἄ. ἐγένοντο μύκητες &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,001:47&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 47&lt;/bibl&gt;. [&lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾰ&lt;/pron&gt;, except in the phrase &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔδμεναι ἄδην&lt;/foreign&gt;; &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; sub &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁδέω&lt;/foreign&gt;.] (From sə&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-δην,&lt;/foreign&gt; cf. Lat. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;lat&quot;&gt;sǎ-tis.&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1252\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1252\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1268\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδήν\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino ou masculino: glândula, órgão glandular; Hipócrates, Galeno; comparação etimológica com latim inguen.\">ἀδήν</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino ou masculino: glândula, órgão glandular; Hipócrates, Galeno; comparação etimológica com latim inguen.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dh/n&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1252&quot; key=&quot;a)dh/n&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδήν&quot;&gt;ἀδήν&lt;/head&gt; (&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁδ-&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdn.Gr.&lt;/author&gt; 2.922&lt;/bibl&gt;), &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ένος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1252.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;gland,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,010:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Art.&lt;/title&gt; 11&lt;/bibl&gt;; later, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0057,017:3:9&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;UP&lt;/title&gt; 3.9&lt;/bibl&gt;, al., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0732,002:2:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Alex.Aphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 2.12&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Hdn.Gr.&lt;/author&gt; l.c. (ṇguen, cf. Lat. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;lat&quot;&gt;inguen.&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1253\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1253\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1269\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηνής\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ές: ignorante, inexperiente, possível conjectura textual em Semônides; os gramáticos antigos também entendem «sem intenção malicio\">ἀδηνής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ές: ignorante, inexperiente, possível conjectura textual em Semônides; os gramáticos antigos também entendem «sem intenção maliciosa». Advérbio ἀδηνέως, sem malícia; derivado ἀδήνεια, ignorância, Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhnh/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1253&quot; key=&quot;a)dhnh/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδηνής&quot;&gt;ἀδηνής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ές&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;δῆνος&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1253.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ignorant, inexperienced,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0260,001:7:53&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Semon.&lt;/author&gt; 7.53&lt;/bibl&gt;, cj. for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁληνής,&lt;/foreign&gt; but expl. as &lt;i&gt;‘without malice prepense’&lt;/i&gt; by Hsch, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4099,001:17:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;EM&lt;/title&gt; 17.11&lt;/bibl&gt;: so in &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-έως&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;without malice,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;διὰ τῆς πόλεως ἀ. γεγωνέοντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;GDI&lt;/title&gt; 5653&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Chios&lt;/placeName&gt;):—hence &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀδήν-εια&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;i&gt;ignorance,&lt;/i&gt; Hsch (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;-είη&lt;/etym&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1254\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1254\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1270\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδηρις\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo de dois gêneros, genitivo -ιος: sem briga, pacífico, sem conflito; epigramas gregos.\">ἄδηρις</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo de dois gêneros, genitivo -ιος: sem briga, pacífico, sem conflito; epigramas gregos.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/dhris&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1254&quot; key=&quot;a)/dhris&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδηρις&quot;&gt;ἄδηρις&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ιος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1254.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;without strife,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:7:440&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 7.440&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;author&gt;Leon.&lt;/author&gt;), Epigr. in &lt;title&gt;Rev.Phil&lt;/title&gt; 19.178 (&lt;placeName&gt;Egypt&lt;/placeName&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1255\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1255\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1271\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδήριτος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem combate, sem contenda, incontestado, indiscutível, inclusive de conquista; Ilíada, Políbio. II. A que não se pode resis\">ἀδήριτος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem combate, sem contenda, incontestado, indiscutível, inclusive de conquista; Ilíada, Políbio. II. A que não se pode resistir, invencível, de necessidade; Ésquilo. Advérbio ἀδηρίτως, sem disputa.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dh/ritos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1255&quot; key=&quot;a)dh/ritos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδήρι-τος&quot;&gt;ἀδήριτος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1255.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;without strife&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;battle,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:17:42&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 17.42&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1255.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;uncontested, undisputed,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:1:2:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 1.2.3&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0579,002:846&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Orph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;A.&lt;/title&gt; 846&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀδηρί-τως&lt;/orth&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:3:93:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 3.93.1&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0060,001:4:14&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.S.&lt;/author&gt; 4.14&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,048:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Caes.&lt;/title&gt; 3&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1255.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;not to be striven against, unconquerable,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀνάγκης σθένος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:105&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 105&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n2244\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n2244\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1272\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ᾍδης\" data-meanings=\"Nome próprio masculino ᾍδης, variantes épicas Ἀΐδης e dóricas Ἀΐδας. I. Hades, deus do mundo subterrâneo, irmão de Zeus e Posêidon; Ilíada, \">ᾍδης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Nome próprio masculino ᾍδης, variantes épicas Ἀΐδης e dóricas Ἀΐδας. I. Hades, deus do mundo subterrâneo, irmão de Zeus e Posêidon; Ilíada, Hesíodo. II. O mundo dos mortos, morada dos espíritos falecidos, inclusive em Lucas 16.23. III. Sepultura, morte, reino da morte; expressões poéticas da «porta de Hades». IV. Genitivo ᾅδου como qualificativo: infernal, funesto, mortal. A etimologia pela privação de «ver» é hipótese.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;cross*(/aidhs&quot; orig_id=&quot;n2244&quot; key=&quot;*(/aidhs&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ᾍδης&quot;&gt;ᾍδης&lt;/head&gt; or &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾅδης&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Att.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ep.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ἀΐδης&lt;/orth&gt;, αο and &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;εω&lt;/itype&gt;; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Dor.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ἀΐδας,&lt;/orth&gt; &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;α&lt;/itype&gt;, used by Trag., in lyr.and anap.: gen. &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἄϊδος&lt;/itype&gt;, dat. &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἄϊδι&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;, Trag., &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; infr.: (perh. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ-&lt;/foreign&gt; priv., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἰδεῖν&lt;/foreign&gt;):—&lt;sense id=&quot;n2244.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;in &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt; only as pr.n. &lt;i&gt;Hades,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ζεὺς καὶ ἐγώ, τρίτατος δʼ Ἀΐδης&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:15:188&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 15.188&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,001:455&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 455&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰν Ἀΐδαο δόμοισι&lt;/foreign&gt; in the &lt;i&gt;nether&lt;/i&gt; world, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:4:834&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 4.834&lt;/bibl&gt;; freq. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰν, εἰς Ἀΐδαο&lt;/foreign&gt; (sc. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δόμοις, δόμους&lt;/foreign&gt;), as &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:22:389&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 22.389&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:21:48&quot;&gt;21.48&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰν Ἄϊδος&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:24:593&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 24.593&lt;/bibl&gt;; Trag. and &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Att.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν Ἅιδου, εἰς Ἅιδου&lt;/foreign&gt; (sc. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἴκῳ, οἶκον&lt;/foreign&gt;), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,003:865&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aj.&lt;/title&gt; 865&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,009:69&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ra.&lt;/title&gt; 69&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἄϊδόσδε,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;i&gt;to the nether world,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:7:330&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 7.330&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;παρʼ Ἅιδῃ, παρʼ Ἅιδην,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 972, &lt;title&gt;OC&lt;/title&gt; 1552:—hence, &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n2244.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;place of departed spirits,&lt;/i&gt; first in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23:244&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 23.244&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰσόκεν αὐτὸς . . Ἄϊδι κεύθωμαι; ἐπὶ τὸν ᾅδην&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,016:14&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cat.&lt;/title&gt; 14&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰς ἀΐδην&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:11:23&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 11.23&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν τῷ ᾅδῃ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,003:16:23&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ev.Luc.&lt;/title&gt; 16.23&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n2244.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; after &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;i&gt;the grave, death,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀΐδαν λαγχάνειν, δέξασθαι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:5:96&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 5.96&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,004:6:15&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;I.&lt;/title&gt; 6(5).15&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾅδης πόντιος&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;death&lt;/i&gt; by sea, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:667&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 667&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,002:13&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Alc.&lt;/title&gt; 13&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,005:1047&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Hipp.&lt;/title&gt; 1047&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾅδου πύλη,&lt;/foreign&gt; Astrol., region below the Horoscope, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1764,001:179:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Vett.Val.&lt;/author&gt; 179.13&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n2244.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; gen. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾅδου&lt;/foreign&gt; with nouns in adjectival sense, &lt;i&gt;devilish,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;θύουσαν ᾅ. μητέρʼ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:1235&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 1235&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾅ. μάγειρος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,001:397&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyc.&lt;/title&gt; 397&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;i&gt;fatal, deadly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δίκτυον, ξίφη ᾅ.,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:1115&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 1115&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,016:1399&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 1399&lt;/bibl&gt;. [&lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾰ&lt;/pron&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt; in all forms exc. &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾱῐδος&lt;/itype&gt; before vowels; &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾱῐδης&lt;/itype&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0260,001:7:117&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Semon.&lt;/author&gt; 7.117&lt;/bibl&gt;, prob. in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,007:1689&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OC&lt;/title&gt; 1689&lt;/bibl&gt;.]&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1256\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1256\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1273\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁδήσω\" data-meanings=\"Forma verbal ἁδήσω: remissão à conjugação de ἁνδάνω, «agradar, satisfazer», sem novo significado próprio.\">ἁδήσω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Forma verbal ἁδήσω: remissão à conjugação de ἁνδάνω, «agradar, satisfazer», sem novo significado próprio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(dh/sw&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1256&quot; key=&quot;a(dh/sw&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁδήσω&quot;&gt;ἁδήσω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; sub &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁνδάνω&lt;/foreign&gt;.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1257\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1257\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1274\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηφαγέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: ser voraz, glutão, consumir avidamente; também de cavalos vorazes ou indisciplinados; Hermipo, Sófocles, Isócrates.\">ἀδηφαγέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: ser voraz, glutão, consumir avidamente; também de cavalos vorazes ou indisciplinados; Hermipo, Sófocles, Isócrates.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhfa^ge/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1257&quot; key=&quot;a)dhfa^ge/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδη-φᾰγέω&quot;&gt;ἀδηφαγέω&lt;/head&gt; &lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;[ᾰδ]&lt;/pron&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1257.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;to be greedy,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0252,001:84&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hermipp.&lt;/author&gt; 84&lt;/bibl&gt;; of horses, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:976&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 976&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,016:55&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 6.55&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1258\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1258\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1275\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδηφαγία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: voracidade, gula, glutonaria, até personificada em culto da Ἀδηφαγία; Calímaco, Aristóteles, Opiano.\">ἀδηφαγία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: voracidade, gula, glutonaria, até personificada em culto da Ἀδηφαγία; Calímaco, Aristóteles, Opiano.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral para cotejo</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dhfa^gi/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1258&quot; key=&quot;a)dhfa^gi/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδη-φᾰγία&quot;&gt;ἀδηφαγία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1258.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;gluttony,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,017:160&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Dian.&lt;/title&gt; 160&lt;/bibl&gt;: pl., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,051:144&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 144&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0023,001:2:218&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Opp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 2.218&lt;/bibl&gt;:—personified, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἀδηφαγίας ἱερόν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0586,001:39&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Polem.Hist.&lt;/author&gt; 39&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>";
